  "answer": "This request has been filed before. Your ticket's text and screenshots were merged into PowerToys#46705, \"Dock: Add support for a band in the taskbar too\". The Command Palette team says a taskbar band is on the roadmap. It's still a prototype with open problems: centered taskbars, display changes, Windows 10, and the Widgets button. Please follow and add your input on #46705, because no release date has been given. For the media controls part, PowerToys#47966 was closed. The team doesn't plan to build a first-party media extension. They recommend the community extension MediaControlsExtension by [user], which gives a Command Palette dock band with media controls and works today. Use that extension now and give feedback in its repo."
 },
